[Script Info]Title: Default Aegisub fileScriptType: v4.00+WrapStyle: 0ScaledBorderAndShadow: yesYCbCr Matrix: TV.709PlayResX: 1920PlayResY: 1080[V4+ Styles]Format: Name, Fontname, Fontsize, PrimaryColour, SecondaryColour, OutlineColour, BackColour, Bold, Italic, Underline, StrikeOut, ScaleX, ScaleY, Spacing, Angle, BorderStyle, Outline, Shadow, Alignment, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, EncodingStyle: Main-207+,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.8,3.8,2,300,300,27,1Style: Secondary-207+,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00D6D6D6,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.8,3.8,2,300,300,27,1Style: Thoughts-207+,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00525252,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,4.2,3.8,2,300,300,27,1Style: Captions-207+,FOT-Greco Std DB Strp,56,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,2,15,15,30,1Style: Note-207+,Impress BT Pace,57,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,&H96000000,0,-1,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.75,3.75,8,300,300,27,1Style: Credits-207+,FOT-Greco Std DB Strp,55,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,105,105,1.5,0,1,3.7,0,7,15,15,15,1Style: Narrator-207+,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,-1,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.8,3.8,8,300,300,27,1Style: Title-207+,M+ ıc,95,&H00FEFEFE,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2.5,0,2,15,15,360,1Style: Flashbacks-207+,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00525252,&H78000000,0,-1,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,4.2,3.8,2,300,300,27,1Style: Warning,Impress BT Pace,90,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2,2,2,10,10,10,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, TextDialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:09.99,Warning,,0,0,0,,Your media player does not support the subtitle format used in this episode. Subtitles will likely not function properly. Please use one of the recommended video players, preferably mpv: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 55,0:00:02.19,0:00:04.11,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,The Great Pirate Era...Dialogue: 55,0:00:04.11,0:00:09.07,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,has proven to be a more tumultuous storm than the World Government expected.Dialogue: 55,0:00:10.91,0:00:18.12,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,The figures in the eye of this relentless tempest are…Dialogue: 55,0:00:20.00,0:00:21.83,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Monkey D. Luffy...Dialogue: 55,0:00:23.13,0:00:25.13,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,and the Straw Hat Pirates!Dialogue: 55,0:00:27.51,0:00:31.39,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,To confront the furious Great Pirate Era,Dialogue: 55,0:00:31.39,0:00:35.85,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,fifty world leaders have come together for this quadrennial conference:Dialogue: 55,0:00:36.72,0:00:39.94,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,the Reverie, which will commence shortly.Dialogue: 55,0:00:44.69,0:00:48.32,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Now is a time of great change.Dialogue: 55,0:00:57.00,0:00:58.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry!Dialogue: 55,0:01:02.33,0:01:03.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's this?Dialogue: 55,0:01:05.55,0:01:07.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where did you get that?!Dialogue: 55,0:01:07.21,0:01:09.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? I just found it in my pocket.Dialogue: 55,0:01:09.80,0:01:11.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cool! Is it real?Dialogue: 55,0:01:11.80,0:01:13.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is it?Dialogue: 55,0:01:13.05,0:01:14.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember?Dialogue: 55,0:01:15.14,0:01:18.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's what Germa used to transform!Dialogue: 55,0:01:18.27,0:01:19.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right!Dialogue: 55,0:01:19.98,0:01:22.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna transform with it!Dialogue: 55,0:01:22.40,0:01:24.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait! I'll go first!Dialogue: 55,0:01:25.61,0:01:27.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Sanji! – Sanji!Dialogue: 55,0:01:27.32,0:01:29.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm getting rid of it.Dialogue: 55,0:01:29.69,0:01:30.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– What?! – What?!Dialogue: 55,0:01:30.99,0:01:32.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare throw it out!Dialogue: 55,0:01:32.82,0:01:35.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do it, and I'll look for it on the ocean floor!Dialogue: 55,0:01:35.70,0:01:38.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd love to see an anchor like you try!Dialogue: 55,0:01:38.49,0:01:42.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was in my pocket. If you don't want it, let me have it instead!Dialogue: 55,0:01:42.54,0:01:44.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, let me have it! Please!Dialogue: 55,0:01:44.96,0:01:45.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way!Dialogue: 55,0:01:47.21,0:01:51.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I wonder how it ended up in Luffy's pocket.Dialogue: 55,0:01:52.09,0:01:53.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It must've been Niji.Dialogue: 55,0:01:53.59,0:01:55.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He did it as a dig against me.Dialogue: 55,0:01:58.14,0:02:03.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't want my strength to come from their crappy technology!Dialogue: 55,0:02:03.19,0:02:04.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Think about it, Sanji!Dialogue: 55,0:02:04.90,0:02:07.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Science is a noble human power!Dialogue: 55,0:02:07.77,0:02:09.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why do you care so much?!Dialogue: 55,0:02:09.82,0:02:13.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– If we used the raid suit... – If we used the raid suit...Dialogue: 55,0:02:18.70,0:02:21.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– maybe we could shoot beams! – maybe we could shoot beams!Dialogue: 55,0:02:21.00,0:02:22.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you guys children?!Dialogue: 55,0:02:22.75,0:02:24.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky already does that just fine!Dialogue: 55,0:02:24.62,0:02:26.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've got enough freaks on our crew.Dialogue: 55,0:02:26.96,0:02:28.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No! It's mine!Dialogue: 55,0:02:28.00,0:02:31.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? Were you making light of science?Dialogue: 55,0:02:31.26,0:02:33.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami my sweet!Dialogue: 55,0:02:33.13,0:02:36.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'd insult your science!Dialogue: 55,0:02:36.26,0:02:42.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My Sorcery Climate Baton is the fusion of sky science and Usopp's engineering!Dialogue: 55,0:02:43.14,0:02:43.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look!Dialogue: 55,0:02:48.40,0:02:50.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I just love being inside her baton!Dialogue: 55,0:02:50.94,0:02:52.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zeus?!Dialogue: 55,0:02:52.28,0:02:54.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You actually tagged along?!Dialogue: 55,0:02:54.03,0:02:56.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't believe food outweighs your loyalty to Big Mom!Dialogue: 55,0:02:56.86,0:02:59.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,♪ I got myself a powerful servant! ♪Dialogue: 55,0:02:59.28,0:03:00.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,N-Nami...Dialogue: 55,0:03:01.91,0:03:03.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zeus, remember this...Dialogue: 55,0:03:04.58,0:03:08.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've been serving Nami since long before you came along!Dialogue: 55,0:03:08.50,0:03:13.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I get to live in the baton she keeps on her at all times!Dialogue: 55,0:03:13.51,0:03:15.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?!Dialogue: 55,0:03:15.05,0:03:17.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji, you're arguing with water vapor.Dialogue: 55,0:03:17.89,0:03:20.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright! Let's go!Dialogue: 55,0:03:21.56,0:03:23.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Why isn't it working?! – Why isn't it working?!Dialogue: 55,0:03:23.81,0:03:24.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop whining!Dialogue: 55,0:03:24.56,0:03:27.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I guess it only works on you!Dialogue: 55,0:03:27.44,0:03:29.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Show us already!Dialogue: 55,0:03:29.27,0:03:30.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up!Dialogue: 55,0:03:30.19,0:03:32.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not part of Germa!Dialogue: 55,0:03:32.19,0:03:38.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen up! "Germa 66" and "Vinsmoke" are two names I never want to hear again!Dialogue: 55,0:03:38.66,0:03:40.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you!Dialogue: 55,0:03:41.41,0:03:44.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please transform!Dialogue: 55,0:03:42.74,0:03:44.50,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,L-Let go of me, you morons!Dialogue: 55,0:03:44.50,0:03:45.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, everybody!Dialogue: 55,0:03:45.75,0:03:47.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The newspaper's here!Dialogue: 55,0:03:47.83,0:03:50.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is there anything about us?Dialogue: 55,0:03:50.00,0:03:51.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's see...Dialogue: 55,0:03:52.46,0:03:53.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A close-up of Luffy!Dialogue: 55,0:03:54.59,0:03:55.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What about Jinbe?Dialogue: 55,0:03:55.92,0:03:58.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Does it say what happened after we left?Dialogue: 55,0:03:59.05,0:04:02.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh... Jinbe, Jinbe…Dialogue: 55,0:04:02.05,0:04:04.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No word of what happened after we left...Dialogue: 55,0:04:04.27,0:04:09.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Only that "Luffy, Sanji, Jinbe, and Bege made an assassination attempt on Big Mom's life."Dialogue: 55,0:04:09.52,0:04:11.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And that "Luffy was the mastermind"!Dialogue: 55,0:04:11.77,0:04:12.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Mastermind"?!Dialogue: 55,0:04:14.40,0:04:15.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, bounty posters!Dialogue: 55,0:04:17.65,0:04:19.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My bounty went up!Dialogue: 55,0:04:19.03,0:04:21.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's 330 million berries!Dialogue: 55,0:04:21.37,0:04:22.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For real?!Dialogue: 55,0:04:22.95,0:04:25.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, what was Moss Head's at?Dialogue: 55,0:04:25.20,0:04:27.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think Zoro's was at...Dialogue: 55,0:04:27.21,0:04:29.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,320 million berries!Dialogue: 55,0:04:29.54,0:04:31.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I did it!Dialogue: 55,0:04:31.71,0:04:33.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm higher than that damn Moss Head!Dialogue: 55,0:04:33.80,0:04:35.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's just a number.Dialogue: 55,0:04:35.92,0:04:40.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They changed "only alive" back to "dead or alive"!Dialogue: 55,0:04:43.35,0:04:46.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's wrong?Dialogue: 55,0:04:46.14,0:04:47.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My name...Dialogue: 55,0:04:51.44,0:04:53.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It says "Vinsmoke Sanji"!Dialogue: 55,0:04:53.94,0:04:55.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Makes sense...Dialogue: 55,0:04:55.53,0:04:59.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My bounty only increased because of Germa's infamy!Dialogue: 55,0:04:59.61,0:05:02.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,S-Sanji! Are you okay?!Dialogue: 55,0:05:02.32,0:05:06.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?! There's an even gloomier aura coming from over there!Dialogue: 55,0:05:08.25,0:05:09.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,L-Luffy!Dialogue: 55,0:05:09.66,0:05:11.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?!Dialogue: 55,0:05:15.46,0:05:17.63,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile...Dialogue: 55,0:05:19.05,0:05:23.59,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,The world is abuzz with talk of the Reverie...Dialogue: 55,0:05:23.59,0:05:28.85,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,the global summit held every four years in the Holy Land of Mary Geoise.Dialogue: 55,0:05:30.14,0:05:34.65,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,This is Fishman Island, 10,000 meters below sea level.Dialogue: 55,0:05:34.65,0:05:37.61,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,The Ryugu Kingdom.Dialogue: 55,0:05:37.61,0:05:39.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He did it-jamon!Dialogue: 55,0:05:39.82,0:05:43.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jinbe finally joined Luffy's crew!Dialogue: 55,0:05:45.07,0:05:49.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's unbelievable to think the two of them fought together against Big Mom.Dialogue: 55,0:05:49.54,0:05:52.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wonder if they escaped on the same ship.Dialogue: 55,0:05:52.42,0:05:55.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jinbe and Straw Hat-fa-so-la-ti-do! ♪Dialogue: 55,0:05:55.71,0:06:00.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course they did. The article says Big Mom was furious.Dialogue: 55,0:06:01.42,0:06:07.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We must officially declare that our country is under the Straw Hats' protection-jamon!Dialogue: 55,0:06:07.22,0:06:09.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dearest Father! Dearest Brothers!Dialogue: 55,0:06:12.48,0:06:14.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shirahoshi.Dialogue: 55,0:06:15.19,0:06:17.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Allow me to attend the Reverie with you!Dialogue: 55,0:06:17.90,0:06:22.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have to go, or Sir Luffy will call me Wimpyhoshi again!Dialogue: 55,0:06:26.78,0:06:29.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you to come around!Dialogue: 55,0:06:29.33,0:06:31.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright, let's go!Dialogue: 55,0:06:32.12,0:06:33.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's!Dialogue: 55,0:06:35.88,0:06:42.92,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,However, overshadowing the upcoming Reverie and stunning the public is the news thatDialogue: 55,0:06:42.92,0:06:48.14,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,rookie pirate Straw Hat Luffy threatened Emperor Big Mom,Dialogue: 55,0:06:48.14,0:06:50.77,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,someone whose position hadn't wavered in decades.Dialogue: 55,0:06:51.64,0:06:53.60,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,The article states the following:Dialogue: 55,0:06:54.31,0:06:57.98,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,"A reliable source has confirmed that Straw Hat LuffyDialogue: 55,0:06:57.98,0:07:01.57,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,has taken command of seven powerful pirate crews.Dialogue: 55,0:07:01.57,0:07:06.82,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,This move makes him the commander of 5,000 subordinates.Dialogue: 55,0:07:07.78,0:07:11.33,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Of note, both Ace and the Revolutionary Army's number two, Sabo,Dialogue: 55,0:07:11.33,0:07:13.96,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,are considered his sworn brothers.Dialogue: 55,0:07:14.96,0:07:20.80,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,He convinced the evil army Germa 66, the Sun Pirates, and the Fire Tank PiratesDialogue: 55,0:07:20.80,0:07:25.42,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,to follow him without hesitation, all due to his leadership and charisma.Dialogue: 55,0:07:26.01,0:07:30.97,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,His guileful strategy resulted in the destruction of the queen's castle.Dialogue: 55,0:07:32.14,0:07:36.06,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,He felled two of her commanders worth 800 million and 1 billion respectively.Dialogue: 55,0:07:37.02,0:07:41.07,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Therefore, it is natural to consider Straw Hat Luffy the victor!"Dialogue: 55,0:07:41.86,0:07:45.03,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,And so, the article concludes with a proclamation:Dialogue: 55,0:07:45.99,0:07:49.87,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,"The Fifth Emperor has emerged!"Dialogue: 55,0:07:53.24,0:07:56.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's all this "Fifth Emperor" garbage?!Dialogue: 55,0:07:56.50,0:08:02.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's just pirate scum causing trouble, whether it's Four Emperors or Five Emperors.Dialogue: 55,0:08:05.63,0:08:08.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have a report for you, Fleet Admiral Sakazuki!Dialogue: 55,0:08:08.76,0:08:13.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,En route to the Reverie, pirates ambushed the ship from Lulusia!Dialogue: 55,0:08:14.02,0:08:18.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The king was unharmed, but Princess Comane has been kidnapped.Dialogue: 55,0:08:18.31,0:08:20.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where was the Marine escort?!Dialogue: 55,0:08:25.78,0:08:26.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Check.Dialogue: 55,0:08:30.03,0:08:32.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Grandfather! Grandfather!Dialogue: 55,0:08:33.33,0:08:34.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is it, Rebecca?Dialogue: 55,0:08:34.79,0:08:35.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look!Dialogue: 55,0:08:36.08,0:08:38.33,Main-207+,,0,0,2,,So? Have you read the news about Lucy?!Dialogue: 55,0:08:38.33,0:08:40.17,Main-207+,,0,0,2,,Yes. Indeed I have.Dialogue: 55,0:08:40.17,0:08:41.33,Main-207+,,0,0,2,,Oh, okay...Dialogue: 55,0:08:41.33,0:08:43.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffyland is amazing!Dialogue: 55,0:08:43.71,0:08:46.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's our boss for you!Dialogue: 55,0:08:46.30,0:08:50.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The article mentioned us too.Dialogue: 55,0:08:51.39,0:08:56.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone, once we reach the Holy Land, you must not talk about this.Dialogue: 55,0:08:56.27,0:08:58.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? Why not?Dialogue: 55,0:08:58.35,0:09:01.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We may be indebted to him,Dialogue: 55,0:09:01.73,0:09:05.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but the World Government and the Marines see him differently.Dialogue: 55,0:09:06.15,0:09:08.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're right! He's a pirate!Dialogue: 55,0:09:08.53,0:09:13.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Exactly. And he's now gaining an extraordinarily dangerous reputation.Dialogue: 55,0:09:13.70,0:09:15.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's really something.Dialogue: 55,0:09:15.20,0:09:17.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah! I've got to show Viola!Dialogue: 55,0:09:18.16,0:09:19.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's show her!Dialogue: 55,0:09:23.42,0:09:28.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No mistaking it. Those ships belong to the Kingdoms of Dressrosa and Prodence!Dialogue: 55,0:09:28.30,0:09:30.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no Marine escort either!Dialogue: 55,0:09:30.67,0:09:34.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh! Th-That's Princess Viola!Dialogue: 55,0:09:34.01,0:09:36.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's as gorgeous as they say.Dialogue: 55,0:09:36.43,0:09:38.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that other girl also a royal?Dialogue: 55,0:09:38.85,0:09:42.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll get to name our price if we kidnap 'em too.Dialogue: 55,0:09:43.85,0:09:46.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right, Princess Comane?Dialogue: 55,0:09:47.11,0:09:49.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just call Papa already!Dialogue: 55,0:09:49.65,0:09:52.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He'll pay you as much as you want!Dialogue: 55,0:09:54.07,0:09:56.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is why I like royal families!Dialogue: 55,0:09:56.33,0:09:58.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just hold out a bit longer.Dialogue: 55,0:09:58.12,0:10:00.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're pretty damn greedy.Dialogue: 55,0:10:00.12,0:10:04.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, they won't see us coming...Dialogue: 55,0:10:04.67,0:10:07.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,since we're hidden underwater!Dialogue: 55,0:10:07.63,0:10:08.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sink 'em!Dialogue: 55,0:10:08.80,0:10:09.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roger!Dialogue: 55,0:10:11.59,0:10:15.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's impossible to guard against a torpedo!Dialogue: 55,0:10:36.57,0:10:37.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What...?!Dialogue: 55,0:10:38.28,0:10:39.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,An ambush?!Dialogue: 55,0:10:40.16,0:10:41.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ready the cannons!Dialogue: 55,0:10:41.45,0:10:42.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yes, sir! – Yes, sir!Dialogue: 55,0:10:44.08,0:10:45.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't! There's no need!Dialogue: 55,0:10:50.30,0:10:51.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I made it in time!Dialogue: 55,0:10:51.92,0:10:53.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're safe now!Dialogue: 55,0:10:53.59,0:10:55.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A-Are you a Marine?Dialogue: 55,0:10:56.97,0:10:59.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm Captain Koby of Marine Headquarters!Dialogue: 55,0:11:00.56,0:11:02.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did we miss the target?!Dialogue: 55,0:11:02.10,0:11:03.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's impossible!Dialogue: 55,0:11:06.90,0:11:10.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're gonna sink!Dialogue: 55,0:11:10.40,0:11:12.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're not hurt, are you?Dialogue: 55,0:11:14.90,0:11:17.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your party came from Dressrosa and Prodence, right?Dialogue: 55,0:11:17.99,0:11:19.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You must be tired, traveling so far.Dialogue: 55,0:11:19.99,0:11:22.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What just happened?Dialogue: 55,0:11:22.37,0:11:24.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How did you get here?Dialogue: 55,0:11:27.54,0:11:30.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I had to go on ahead of my ship.Dialogue: 55,0:11:31.67,0:11:36.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just now, pirates were targeting you from underwater.Dialogue: 55,0:11:36.13,0:11:37.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Underwater"...?Dialogue: 55,0:11:37.89,0:11:39.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You mean by a torpedo?!Dialogue: 55,0:11:39.60,0:11:41.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm glad they missed!Dialogue: 55,0:11:41.64,0:11:42.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Me too.Dialogue: 55,0:11:44.48,0:11:46.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Helmeppo! Report!Dialogue: 55,0:11:46.85,0:11:48.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We caught the pirates!Dialogue: 55,0:11:53.48,0:11:54.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look!Dialogue: 55,0:11:55.07,0:11:57.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Princess Comane from Lulusia is okay too!Dialogue: 55,0:11:57.82,0:11:59.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why you little...!Dialogue: 55,0:11:59.24,0:12:01.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roast these jerks on a skewer!Dialogue: 55,0:12:01.37,0:12:02.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They need to pay!Dialogue: 55,0:12:02.99,0:12:05.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course, they'll pay dearly, Princess!Dialogue: 55,0:12:05.70,0:12:10.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, what's the deal with your observation haki, Koby?!Dialogue: 55,0:12:10.71,0:12:14.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I never even sensed the torpedo.Dialogue: 55,0:12:16.55,0:12:17.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A submarine...?Dialogue: 55,0:12:17.88,0:12:20.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You have to be careful with pirates these days...Dialogue: 55,0:12:20.55,0:12:22.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was close.Dialogue: 55,0:12:22.26,0:12:23.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hello!Dialogue: 55,0:12:25.06,0:12:27.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, you're the famous Captain Koby!Dialogue: 55,0:12:27.56,0:12:28.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 55,0:12:28.69,0:12:30.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,From the Rocky Port Incident?Dialogue: 55,0:12:30.98,0:12:37.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Trafalgar Law, one of the Worst Generation, was the mastermind behind that incident.Dialogue: 55,0:12:37.19,0:12:40.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're the hero who protected the citizens.Dialogue: 55,0:12:42.32,0:12:45.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,N-No, I'm no hero!Dialogue: 55,0:12:45.20,0:12:48.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're not just brave, you're a fine young man!Dialogue: 55,0:12:48.41,0:12:51.29,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow... This guy is strong...Dialogue: 55,0:12:51.63,0:12:55.50,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,He just saved us from a torpedo, yet he doesn't want any credit?Dialogue: 55,0:12:55.50,0:12:56.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you!Dialogue: 55,0:12:56.92,0:12:58.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's nothing...Dialogue: 55,0:12:58.55,0:13:00.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh! Luffy!Dialogue: 55,0:13:00.55,0:13:03.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's Straw Hat Luffy!Dialogue: 55,0:13:03.05,0:13:05.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The front-page article caught my eye.Dialogue: 55,0:13:05.68,0:13:07.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you wanna read it, Koby?Dialogue: 55,0:13:07.14,0:13:10.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, no. Well, I mean, you know...Dialogue: 55,0:13:14.69,0:13:16.82,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,"The Fifth Emperor."Dialogue: 55,0:13:18.11,0:13:21.57,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy's still as cool as ever!Dialogue: 55,0:13:22.66,0:13:25.24,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,He keeps moving forward!Dialogue: 55,0:13:26.24,0:13:27.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Koby?Dialogue: 55,0:13:32.58,0:13:36.55,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Every time I see you in the paper, I think back to that day...Dialogue: 55,0:13:40.80,0:13:42.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Captain Koby!Dialogue: 55,0:13:42.09,0:13:44.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? Come back already!Dialogue: 55,0:13:44.30,0:13:45.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right!Dialogue: 55,0:13:49.89,0:13:51.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!Dialogue: 55,0:13:52.69,0:13:53.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sure.Dialogue: 55,0:13:54.44,0:14:01.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seeing how close we are to New Marineford, allow us to escort you the rest of the way!Dialogue: 55,0:14:02.32,0:14:04.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I give you my thanks.Dialogue: 55,0:14:05.41,0:14:06.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey!Dialogue: 55,0:14:08.08,0:14:09.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is it?Dialogue: 55,0:14:09.20,0:14:11.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you like Lucy, Koby?Dialogue: 55,0:14:11.33,0:14:13.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You like Luffyland, right?Dialogue: 55,0:14:13.21,0:14:15.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,N-No! H-He's my enemy!Dialogue: 55,0:14:15.83,0:14:17.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can't fool us!Dialogue: 55,0:14:17.96,0:14:19.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We won't tell.Dialogue: 55,0:14:19.51,0:14:21.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stay and chat.Dialogue: 55,0:14:21.26,0:14:25.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,K-Kindly let go! I-I'm with the Marines!Dialogue: 55,0:14:25.26,0:14:28.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But you looked so happy when you read the paper.Dialogue: 55,0:14:28.06,0:14:29.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Th-That's because...Dialogue: 55,0:14:29.64,0:14:32.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on. Let's talk!Dialogue: 55,0:14:30.89,0:14:32.43,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,P-Please stop!Dialogue: 55,0:14:32.85,0:14:35.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, Luffyland is in this article here too!Dialogue: 55,0:14:35.56,0:14:36.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He is?!Dialogue: 55,0:14:36.61,0:14:39.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you do like him!Dialogue: 55,0:14:46.87,0:14:47.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn...Dialogue: 55,0:14:48.83,0:14:51.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Having my bounty increase because of Germa's reputation...Dialogue: 55,0:14:52.33,0:14:55.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,is so depressing.Dialogue: 55,0:14:58.29,0:15:00.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you all right?Dialogue: 55,0:15:00.71,0:15:02.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do your wounds hurt?Dialogue: 55,0:15:03.42,0:15:05.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,N-No!Dialogue: 55,0:15:05.80,0:15:07.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My...Dialogue: 55,0:15:09.18,0:15:12.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My bounty went down!Dialogue: 55,0:15:12.98,0:15:14.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look!Dialogue: 55,0:15:14.10,0:15:16.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's 150 million berries!Dialogue: 55,0:15:16.06,0:15:17.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– What?! – What?!Dialogue: 55,0:15:18.81,0:15:22.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Really?! I thought it just increased to 500 million recently!Dialogue: 55,0:15:22.86,0:15:26.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One hundred fifty million is lower than your bounty two years ago!Dialogue: 55,0:15:26.99,0:15:29.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How is that even possible?!Dialogue: 55,0:15:29.58,0:15:31.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you do something wrong?!Dialogue: 55,0:15:31.87,0:15:33.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't that make it bigger?Dialogue: 55,0:15:33.37,0:15:35.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.Dialogue: 55,0:15:37.88,0:15:39.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not so bad.Dialogue: 55,0:15:39.04,0:15:40.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fewer people will come after us.Dialogue: 55,0:15:40.92,0:15:42.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami!Dialogue: 55,0:15:42.50,0:15:43.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy is our captain!Dialogue: 55,0:15:43.92,0:15:46.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This could harm our reputation!Dialogue: 55,0:15:46.18,0:15:49.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This sucks! Why?!Dialogue: 55,0:15:51.76,0:15:53.89,Main-207+,,0,0,8,,Prepare the cannons!Dialogue: 55,0:15:53.89,0:15:56.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fire at will!Dialogue: 55,0:16:00.11,0:16:02.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go!Dialogue: 55,0:16:02.61,0:16:05.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Grab their money and valuables!Dialogue: 55,0:16:05.82,0:16:07.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where are the Marines?!Dialogue: 55,0:16:07.70,0:16:10.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Didn't they already arrive to help?!Dialogue: 55,0:16:11.66,0:16:13.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They destroyed our ship!Dialogue: 55,0:16:15.95,0:16:17.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn!Dialogue: 55,0:16:24.25,0:16:26.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To hell with the Marines!Dialogue: 55,0:16:26.92,0:16:29.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Their king's gone to the Reverie.Dialogue: 55,0:16:29.55,0:16:33.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All their best soldiers went away with him!Dialogue: 55,0:16:33.14,0:16:38.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A defenseless country is just begging pirates to raid it!Dialogue: 55,0:16:39.56,0:16:41.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now listen good!Dialogue: 55,0:16:43.19,0:16:46.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm affiliated with Blackbeard, one of the Four Emperors!Dialogue: 55,0:16:46.78,0:16:50.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have been dubbed Pinkbeard!Dialogue: 55,0:16:50.78,0:16:52.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Remember my name!Dialogue: 55,0:16:52.95,0:16:55.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fear Blackbeard!Dialogue: 55,0:16:57.04,0:16:58.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right, men!Dialogue: 55,0:16:58.83,0:17:02.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In the name of Blackbeard, take everything!Dialogue: 55,0:17:09.34,0:17:11.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, hand over your money!Dialogue: 55,0:17:11.80,0:17:13.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,P-Please stop!Dialogue: 55,0:17:14.81,0:17:16.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's no use hiding!Dialogue: 55,0:17:16.89,0:17:19.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll burn the whole town down!Dialogue: 55,0:17:22.23,0:17:23.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on!Dialogue: 55,0:17:23.73,0:17:24.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here!Dialogue: 55,0:17:31.70,0:17:33.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, catch that girl!Dialogue: 55,0:17:36.16,0:17:38.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop right there!Dialogue: 55,0:17:39.79,0:17:42.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's that in your arms?Dialogue: 55,0:17:42.58,0:17:47.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gimme a gander at what you're holding so tightly!Dialogue: 55,0:17:48.51,0:17:49.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is...Dialogue: 55,0:17:49.34,0:17:51.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Just milk?!Dialogue: 55,0:17:52.38,0:17:54.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And here I thought it was money...Dialogue: 55,0:17:54.05,0:17:56.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Screw it! I'll take it anyway.Dialogue: 55,0:17:56.64,0:17:58.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't! This is for the village children!Dialogue: 55,0:17:58.31,0:18:00.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't! This is for the village children!Dialogue: 55,0:18:00.43,0:18:01.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Put a sock in it!Dialogue: 55,0:18:07.44,0:18:10.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're being awful obstinate about this!Dialogue: 55,0:18:13.32,0:18:15.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please give it back!Dialogue: 55,0:18:15.07,0:18:16.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That milk...Dialogue: 55,0:18:16.83,0:18:19.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't go without it!Dialogue: 55,0:18:19.16,0:18:20.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?!Dialogue: 55,0:18:20.33,0:18:23.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then bring us your money instead!Dialogue: 55,0:18:23.04,0:18:24.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 55,0:18:24.08,0:18:25.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't have any.Dialogue: 55,0:18:25.96,0:18:28.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't you have a heavenly tribute fund?Dialogue: 55,0:18:29.67,0:18:34.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Th-The heavenly tribute is for the king and the Celestial Dragons.Dialogue: 55,0:18:34.76,0:18:39.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's all we can do to scrimp and save every day!Dialogue: 55,0:18:39.72,0:18:43.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll face execution if we don't pay the heavenly tribute!Dialogue: 55,0:18:43.19,0:18:44.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 55,0:18:44.31,0:18:47.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your king sounds terrible!Dialogue: 55,0:18:47.06,0:18:48.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, alright!Dialogue: 55,0:18:49.98,0:18:52.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, men, get searching!Dialogue: 55,0:18:52.40,0:18:55.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're hiding the heavenly tribute!Dialogue: 55,0:18:56.87,0:18:58.28,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,The money's stashed away!Dialogue: 55,0:18:58.28,0:18:59.49,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Take all they've got!Dialogue: 55,0:18:58.62,0:18:59.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But why?!Dialogue: 55,0:19:00.45,0:19:02.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C'mon! Tell us where the tribute is!Dialogue: 55,0:19:02.91,0:19:04.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Leave us alone...Dialogue: 55,0:19:04.67,0:19:06.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This town is poor.Dialogue: 55,0:19:06.25,0:19:08.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,P-Please, anything but the fund!Dialogue: 55,0:19:08.38,0:19:09.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let go!Dialogue: 55,0:19:11.46,0:19:13.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Somebody...Dialogue: 55,0:19:13.26,0:19:16.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't have gotten hurt if you'd just given up!Dialogue: 55,0:19:16.72,0:19:19.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kill anyone who resists!Dialogue: 55,0:19:21.06,0:19:22.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you!Dialogue: 55,0:19:22.52,0:19:25.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please just leave us alone!Dialogue: 55,0:19:25.56,0:19:26.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up!Dialogue: 55,0:19:30.32,0:19:32.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go, Morley!Dialogue: 55,0:19:33.94,0:19:35.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?Dialogue: 55,0:19:38.53,0:19:40.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why's it shaking?Dialogue: 55,0:19:50.04,0:19:52.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is there something underground?!Dialogue: 55,0:20:00.60,0:20:01.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The hell?!Dialogue: 55,0:20:01.85,0:20:03.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A giant trident?!Dialogue: 55,0:20:11.15,0:20:12.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that a giant?Dialogue: 55,0:20:12.52,0:20:15.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One, two! One, two!Dialogue: 55,0:20:15.94,0:20:18.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One, two! One...Dialogue: 55,0:20:18.36,0:20:20.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,two!Dialogue: 55,0:20:25.37,0:20:28.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A giant just climbed straight from the ground!Dialogue: 55,0:20:28.87,0:20:31.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And he's dressed really weird!Dialogue: 55,0:20:32.17,0:20:35.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Um, why is he wearing a miniskirt?Dialogue: 55,0:20:37.01,0:20:40.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gross! Just where do you think you're looking?!Dialogue: 55,0:20:43.76,0:20:46.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why are you staring at me?!Dialogue: 55,0:20:46.77,0:20:49.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you have a crush on me or something?!Dialogue: 55,0:20:49.85,0:20:52.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're actually accusing me of that?!Dialogue: 55,0:20:52.11,0:20:54.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's this dirty old man's deal?!Dialogue: 55,0:20:54.90,0:20:57.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just shoot him! Shoot him dead!Dialogue: 55,0:20:57.65,0:20:58.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Say what?!Dialogue: 55,0:21:00.07,0:21:02.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop fawning over me, sillies!Dialogue: 55,0:21:05.91,0:21:09.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,D-Do giants live underground?!Dialogue: 55,0:21:09.92,0:21:11.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,First one I've ever seen...Dialogue: 55,0:21:11.42,0:21:13.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who is he anyway?Dialogue: 55,0:21:13.21,0:21:16.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't be so mean!Dialogue: 55,0:21:16.09,0:21:18.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on!Dialogue: 55,0:21:18.34,0:21:21.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How's this possible?! He's pushing the ground around like clay!Dialogue: 55,0:21:21.47,0:21:24.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't waver! It's just his power!Dialogue: 55,0:21:25.01,0:21:26.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Incredible!Dialogue: 55,0:21:26.64,0:21:29.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So...? What'll you do now?Dialogue: 55,0:21:30.06,0:21:31.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You servile...Dialogue: 55,0:21:32.27,0:21:34.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,pieces of trash.Dialogue: 55,0:21:34.06,0:21:36.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? Trash?Dialogue: 55,0:21:36.19,0:21:38.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What should we do?Dialogue: 55,0:21:38.57,0:21:39.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Excuse me!Dialogue: 55,0:21:39.53,0:21:42.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who are...? Who are you people?Dialogue: 55,0:21:53.12,0:21:54.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, my!Dialogue: 55,0:21:55.04,0:21:56.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come now, come now!Dialogue: 55,0:21:56.34,0:21:58.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait just a tick, Morley!Dialogue: 55,0:21:59.34,0:22:01.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do you want?Dialogue: 55,0:22:02.43,0:22:05.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, please! I wanted to take my latest invention out for a spin,Dialogue: 55,0:22:05.85,0:22:08.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but you ran on ahead!Dialogue: 55,0:22:08.31,0:22:10.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who are these people?!Dialogue: 55,0:22:16.77,0:22:18.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A murder of crows?!Dialogue: 55,0:22:19.23,0:22:20.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain!Dialogue: 55,0:22:20.24,0:22:20.86,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?!Dialogue: 55,0:22:20.86,0:22:23.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,S-Someone's on the roof!Dialogue: 55,0:22:23.66,0:22:25.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 55,0:22:25.70,0:22:27.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The crows are gathering...!Dialogue: 55,0:22:36.71,0:22:40.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How dare you hurt those who offer no resistance.Dialogue: 55,0:22:41.97,0:22:45.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain Pinkbeard... those four...!Dialogue: 55,0:22:45.89,0:22:48.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're usually scattered around the world!Dialogue: 55,0:22:49.35,0:22:50.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're the commanders...Dialogue: 55,0:22:51.39,0:22:53.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,of the Revolutionary Army!Dialogue: 55,0:22:54.48,0:22:56.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wh... Wh...Dialogue: 55,0:22:56.27,0:22:59.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 55,0:23:00.86,0:23:03.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, they're still staring at me.Dialogue: 55,0:23:05.36,0:23:08.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Keep your shirts on, trash!Dialogue: 55,0:23:09.16,0:23:12.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Allow me to test my new weapon!Dialogue: 55,0:23:13.83,0:23:17.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're done getting your way.Dialogue: 55,0:23:18.71,0:23:20.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The commanders of...Dialogue: 55,0:23:20.75,0:23:22.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the Revolutionary Army?Dialogue: 55,0:23:28.68,0:23:30.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heehaw!Dialogue: 55,0:23:30.89,0:23:33.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That Straw-boy sure is something!Dialogue: 55,0:23:33.56,0:23:36.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He certainly has your blood.Dialogue: 55,0:23:37.31,0:23:38.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And...Dialogue: 55,0:23:38.56,0:23:42.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,who knew that Sanji-boy vass a Germa 66 prince?!Dialogue: 55,0:23:42.78,0:23:46.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He never spoke a voord of it to me!Dialogue: 55,0:23:46.20,0:23:47.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vhaat a rascal!Dialogue: 55,0:23:47.91,0:23:52.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This debacle led to Germa's expulsion from the World Government.Dialogue: 55,0:23:52.62,0:23:57.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I expected nothing less of Straw-boy and Sanji-boy.Dialogue: 55,0:23:57.54,0:24:01.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They are the driving force of the Great Pirate Era!Dialogue: 55,0:24:01.92,0:24:05.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats... Vhaat excitement!Dialogue: 55,0:24:05.97,0:24:09.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, the commanders are late.Dialogue: 55,0:24:09.72,0:24:12.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They should have arrived by now.Dialogue: 55,0:24:12.56,0:24:14.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That is true...Dialogue: 55,0:24:14.31,0:24:15.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By the vayy, Sabo...Dialogue: 55,0:24:15.93,0:24:18.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,vhaat are you doing over there?Dialogue: 55,0:24:20.61,0:24:25.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's been grinning since reading the news about Luffy, so his face cramped up, didn't it?Dialogue: 55,0:24:25.65,0:24:27.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vhaat a dum-dum!Dialogue: 55,0:24:30.37,0:24:31.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lindbergh here!Dialogue: 55,0:24:31.62,0:24:34.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Everyone's waiting.Dialogue: 55,0:24:34.08,0:24:35.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is this Sabo?Dialogue: 55,0:24:35.20,0:24:37.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're almost there.Dialogue: 55,0:24:37.04,0:24:38.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But we ran into some trouble!Dialogue: 55,0:24:38.87,0:24:40.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mind if we're a bit late?Dialogue: 55,0:24:41.13,0:24:43.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Got it. Just stay in one piece.Dialogue: 55,0:24:44.96,0:24:47.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm so excited!Dialogue: 55,0:24:47.13,0:24:51.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All of the Revolutionary Army's officiers will be here!Dialogue: 55,0:24:51.22,0:24:53.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I get to see Commander Morley!Dialogue: 55,0:24:53.97,0:24:56.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mistress Betty is my favorite!Dialogue: 55,0:24:56.98,0:25:01.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sabo, the clock is ticking. We need to start.Dialogue: 55,0:25:01.23,0:25:04.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It'd be best if we finalize the plan before they arrive.Dialogue: 55,0:25:04.73,0:25:07.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're up, Chief of Staff.Dialogue: 55,0:25:07.69,0:25:08.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah.Dialogue: 55,0:25:09.20,0:25:13.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At the upcoming Reverie, we'll finally...Dialogue: 55,0:25:15.12,0:25:17.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...declare war...Dialogue: 55,0:25:18.37,0:25:20.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,against the Celestial Dragons.Dialogue: 55,0:25:22.29,0:25:23.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So they're...Dialogue: 55,0:25:24.34,0:25:25.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the commanders of...Dialogue: 55,0:25:26.46,0:25:27.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the Revolutionary Army!Dialogue: 55,0:25:31.01,0:25:33.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why are four of their officers here?!Dialogue: 55,0:25:33.89,0:25:36.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gosh, you boys play rough!Dialogue: 55,0:25:36.51,0:25:39.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe because they're keen on you, you giant lug!Dialogue: 55,0:25:39.39,0:25:41.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way. That's icky!Dialogue: 55,0:25:41.19,0:25:45.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I checked in with Sabo, so shall we begin, Betty?!Dialogue: 55,0:25:45.77,0:25:47.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no stopping me.Dialogue: 55,0:25:48.57,0:25:50.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like they won't answer my question.Dialogue: 55,0:25:50.95,0:25:53.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And what's that guy mumbling about over there?!Dialogue: 55,0:25:53.74,0:25:56.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I deem your actions unforgivable!Dialogue: 55,0:25:56.33,0:25:58.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why's he so pissed?!Dialogue: 55,0:25:58.83,0:26:02.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's it gonna be, you pieces of trash?!Dialogue: 55,0:26:02.21,0:26:03.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Will you die?Dialogue: 55,0:26:03.75,0:26:04.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Or will you fight?!Dialogue: 55,0:26:06.42,0:26:09.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Choose your destiny!Dialogue: 55,0:26:11.80,0:26:14.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why leave being a hero to someone else?!Dialogue: 55,0:26:18.06,0:26:20.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You could be heroes!Dialogue: 55,0:26:41.04,0:26:45.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The townspeople picked up sticks! C'mon! Don't make me laugh!Dialogue: 55,0:26:45.79,0:26:48.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna fight us?!Dialogue: 55,0:26:50.30,0:26:54.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know why, but I'm inspired and feel a surge of energy!Dialogue: 55,0:26:54.43,0:26:56.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's drive these pirates out of here!Dialogue: 55,0:26:57.18,0:26:59.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We should fight to protect our country!Dialogue: 55,0:27:02.35,0:27:03.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right!Dialogue: 55,0:27:03.73,0:27:06.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the power of Betty's Rally-Rally Fruit!Dialogue: 55,0:27:06.86,0:27:11.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By waving her flag, she can awaken the latent power in anyone!Dialogue: 55,0:27:11.61,0:27:14.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Betty is the flag-bearer of freedom!Dialogue: 55,0:27:14.82,0:27:17.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, charge!Dialogue: 55,0:27:23.41,0:27:25.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't think they know it hurts to get shot!Dialogue: 55,0:27:25.67,0:27:27.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gotta put you in your place!Dialogue: 55,0:27:29.88,0:27:32.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lind! Karasu! Back them up!Dialogue: 55,0:27:32.63,0:27:34.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Got it!Dialogue: 55,0:27:34.88,0:27:35.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take this!Dialogue: 55,0:27:35.68,0:27:38.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cool Shooter!Dialogue: 55,0:27:38.55,0:27:39.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's cold!Dialogue: 55,0:27:39.80,0:27:41.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My gun just froze over!Dialogue: 55,0:27:41.60,0:27:44.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You rotten bastards! Get out of here, you pirates!Dialogue: 55,0:27:46.81,0:27:50.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't waver! Cut them down!Dialogue: 55,0:27:50.15,0:27:51.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take their weapons!Dialogue: 55,0:27:57.45,0:27:59.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The crows took our swords!Dialogue: 55,0:27:59.57,0:28:00.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give 'em back!Dialogue: 55,0:28:00.78,0:28:02.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't stop!Dialogue: 55,0:28:02.58,0:28:04.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't give in to fate!Dialogue: 55,0:28:04.25,0:28:06.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fight!Dialogue: 55,0:28:07.08,0:28:09.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get lost!Dialogue: 55,0:28:13.96,0:28:17.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's gotten into them all of a sudden?!Dialogue: 55,0:28:17.09,0:28:19.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give me...Dialogue: 55,0:28:19.51,0:28:20.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,back...Dialogue: 55,0:28:23.39,0:28:26.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,my milk!Dialogue: 55,0:28:45.29,0:28:46.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's scram!Dialogue: 55,0:28:46.45,0:28:48.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This isn't over!Dialogue: 55,0:28:49.71,0:28:53.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pinkbeard... has a bounty of 52 million.Dialogue: 55,0:28:54.88,0:28:58.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Emperor Blackbeard will come after you...Dialogue: 55,0:28:58.72,0:29:02.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately for you, that man cares little for his men.Dialogue: 55,0:29:03.10,0:29:06.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, boy! Shut your pie hole already!Dialogue: 55,0:29:08.77,0:29:12.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, you yellow-bellied, weak-kneed, pathetic clowns!Dialogue: 55,0:29:15.02,0:29:18.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you turn him in to the World Government...Dialogue: 55,0:29:18.03,0:29:19.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you can claim his bounty.Dialogue: 55,0:29:20.66,0:29:24.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's 52 million berries.Dialogue: 55,0:29:24.03,0:29:25.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And...Dialogue: 55,0:29:25.12,0:29:27.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,it's all yours!Dialogue: 55,0:29:29.66,0:29:32.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Also, I want you to have this.Dialogue: 55,0:29:33.33,0:29:36.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Use this to contact the Revolutionary Army.Dialogue: 55,0:29:40.09,0:29:42.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You did great...Dialogue: 55,0:29:42.30,0:29:43.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 55,0:29:44.64,0:29:46.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Call us any time.Dialogue: 55,0:29:46.76,0:29:48.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll never turn our backs...Dialogue: 55,0:29:49.39,0:29:52.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,on the weaklings who want to rise up.Dialogue: 55,0:30:03.57,0:30:06.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,M-Mistress Belo Betty!Dialogue: 55,0:30:12.37,0:30:15.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you for everything, Revolutionary Army!Dialogue: 55,0:30:24.59,0:30:28.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are we meeting up for this time?Dialogue: 55,0:30:29.02,0:30:31.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're gonna pick a fight with the Celestial Dragons.Dialogue: 55,0:30:31.52,0:30:35.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's the best news ever! I can't wait!Dialogue: 55,0:30:35.19,0:30:36.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, and Karasu!Dialogue: 55,0:30:37.52,0:30:39.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Turn on your voice amplifier.Dialogue: 55,0:30:42.95,0:30:44.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I forgot.Dialogue: 55,0:30:46.62,0:30:49.49,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Two days remain before the Reverie begins.Dialogue: 55,0:30:49.49,0:30:54.12,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,All the pieces from around the world are beginning to coalesce.Dialogue: 55,0:30:55.54,0:30:57.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, roger that.Dialogue: 55,0:30:58.25,0:31:00.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was the others, Sabo.Dialogue: 55,0:31:01.30,0:31:03.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They'll arrive shortly.Dialogue: 55,0:31:03.13,0:31:04.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right!Dialogue: 55,0:31:05.80,0:31:07.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's get a move on.Dialogue: 55,0:31:10.64,0:31:13.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell?!Dialogue: 55,0:31:13.14,0:31:19.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why was that punk who screwed with my valuable SMILE trade deal...Dialogue: 55,0:31:19.52,0:31:22.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,in that old hag's territory?!Dialogue: 55,0:31:30.24,0:31:33.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, so he's the victor?!Dialogue: 55,0:31:33.66,0:31:34.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?!Dialogue: 55,0:31:34.79,0:31:37.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When exactly did I lose?!Dialogue: 55,0:31:38.25,0:31:41.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was him, Mama! He printed this article!Dialogue: 55,0:31:41.25,0:31:44.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, you'll pay for this, Morgans–Dialogue: 55,0:31:44.63,0:31:45.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No!Dialogue: 55,0:31:48.59,0:31:52.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The one who'll really pay...Dialogue: 55,0:31:52.56,0:31:55.27,Main-207+,,0,0,2,,is Straw Hat!Dialogue: 55,0:31:57.35,0:31:59.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,An Emperor?Dialogue: 55,0:31:59.11,0:32:01.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a bit premature to call you that!Dialogue: 55,0:32:12.66,0:32:15.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like I'll be seeing you soon...Dialogue: 55,0:32:17.71,0:32:18.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 55,0:32:28.05,0:32:31.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, your bounty fell. What can we do?Dialogue: 55,0:32:31.35,0:32:33.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cheer up, Luffy.Dialogue: 55,0:32:33.60,0:32:35.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me help in some way.Dialogue: 55,0:32:35.18,0:32:36.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's do what we can!Dialogue: 55,0:32:36.56,0:32:39.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you want me to cook you something?Dialogue: 55,0:32:40.61,0:32:41.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah...Dialogue: 55,0:32:45.82,0:32:46.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 55,0:32:47.53,0:32:49.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait just. One. Minute.Dialogue: 55,0:32:54.70,0:32:55.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look.Dialogue: 55,0:32:56.25,0:33:00.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,100 thousand, 1 million, 10 million...Dialogue: 55,0:33:00.50,0:33:02.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,100 milli–Dialogue: 55,0:33:04.96,0:33:07.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your bounty...Dialogue: 55,0:33:10.18,0:33:13.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,is 1.5 billion berries!Dialogue: 55,0:33:13.97,0:33:19.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– What?! – What?!Dialogue: 55,0:33:20.14,0:33:25.27,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,The world looks toward the Reverie while the crew heads toward Wano.Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.71,0:05:14.46,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,The Fifth EmperorDialogue: 1,0:05:09.71,0:05:14.46,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,The Fifth EmperorDialogue: 0,0:00:52.20,0:00:55.66,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,At Sea in the New WorldDialogue: 1,0:00:52.20,0:00:55.66,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,At Sea in the New WorldDialogue: 0,0:05:45.28,0:05:49.54,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,King Neptune Ryugu KingdomDialogue: 1,0:05:45.28,0:05:49.54,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,King Neptune Ryugu KingdomDialogue: 0,0:05:49.57,0:05:49.62,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ManboshiDialogue: 0,0:05:49.62,0:05:49.66,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ManboshiDialogue: 0,0:05:49.66,0:05:49.70,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ManboshiDialogue: 0,0:05:49.70,0:05:49.74,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ManboshiDialogue: 0,0:05:49.74,0:05:49.78,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ManboshiDialogue: 0,0:05:49.78,0:05:49.82,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ManboshiDialogue: 0,0:05:49.82,0:05:49.87,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ManboshiDialogue: 0,0:05:49.87,0:05:49.91,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ManboshiDialogue: 0,0:05:49.91,0:05:49.95,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ManboshiDialogue: 0,0:05:49.95,0:05:49.99,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ManboshiDialogue: 0,0:05:49.99,0:05:50.03,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ManboshiDialogue: 0,0:05:50.03,0:05:50.07,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ManboshiDialogue: 0,0:05:50.07,0:05:50.12,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ManboshiDialogue: 0,0:05:50.12,0:05:50.16,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ManboshiDialogue: 0,0:05:50.16,0:05:50.20,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ManboshiDialogue: 0,0:05:50.20,0:05:50.24,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ManboshiDialogue: 0,0:05:50.24,0:05:50.28,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ManboshiDialogue: 0,0:05:50.28,0:05:50.32,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ManboshiDialogue: 0,0:05:50.32,0:05:50.37,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ManboshiDialogue: 0,0:05:50.37,0:05:50.41,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ManboshiDialogue: 0,0:05:50.41,0:05:50.45,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ManboshiDialogue: 0,0:05:50.45,0:05:50.49,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ManboshiDialogue: 0,0:05:50.49,0:05:50.53,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,ManboshiDialogue: 0,0:05:50.